{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "30e5a7cd70ce1b43188ef6ff3bcb552f6f2f411bb092a285d0bdcdcc82bf874b", "ja": "（今日はひなたのCM撮影。ひなたは空飛ぶフォークに\n乗って、パンを届ける配達員という設定だ）", "zh": "（日向今天要拍摄广告，而她在设定上是一个\n坐在会飞的叉子上，四处送面包的快递员。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6de75748d917dea7ec5b986a48c70b60a50b7a6889ef59ab5a5d611f49aa7846", "ja": "（イメージしづらい役柄かもしれないと思ったけど、\n順調に進んでいる。そろそろ、休憩時間だ）", "zh": "（这个角色或许不容易揣摩，但拍摄\n进行得很顺利。差不多到休息时间了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "8f9c55d3dda266c83c46dc6263e64ee38c2373e70330e84ea23c6234ff74f378", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさんです。\nあたしのお芝居、どうだっただろか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n你觉得我刚刚演得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3beadec5074f1ce966daf91df6e2a8b3a9de53786dea2dc0628b0912dd32712c", "ja": "お疲れさま、ひなた。\nうん、いい感じだ。今のところ順調だよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，日向。\n嗯，感觉不错，目前都很顺利喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "98d833ac09c997b9eae46c5ff2d17526c75c56e0f0e73b6c39c44a744ecf13ca", "ja": "えへへ……♪　それなら、よかったよぉ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪那真是太好了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "6d5bfc56ed567bbfb87444e963867ea55889b639758e5000e333d3479e151663", "ja": "あたし、お芝居ってそんなに得意でないから。\nうまくできてるか、ちょっこし不安だったんだけども。", "zh": "我不是那么擅长演戏，\n所以有点担心自己演得到底好不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "e53eb8d3dc4df9026c00d889e926f33479bd1ce913270860cd0131210474ac37", "ja": "{$P$}。\nこのCMって、たくさんの人が見るっしょや？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n这支广告会有很多人看对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c72f4bca6fb90e0119bbbdd0c32d8e50b1467636a0fa41b2ef3e5387393bd4a1", "ja": "そうだな。ファンの人達だけでなく、いろんな人に\n見てもらえるはずだ。頑張りどころだと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊，除了粉丝之外，应该还有\n不少人会看到，我觉得现在正是努力的好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "bb563f1c1d0cee28348fa279b383afe3a141d39fdc4a0bd94887fe8217a66b82", "ja": "そうだよねぇ。あたし、がんばらねばなぁ。\n田舎の家族も、きっと見てくれるだろうし……。", "zh": "说得也是呢，我得加油才行哪。\n住在乡下的家人肯定也会收看的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "a82d7e1ac1242fa188e146e069ee5d70c7b905e4e801f91832b13150a52364fb", "ja": "ばあちゃん、あたしがどんなお仕事してるか、\nチェックしてくれてるみたいなんだわ。", "zh": "奶奶好像有在关注我接了怎样的工作喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "96c6d2894c4ace3dfd6f07082ec55ee37bab850aff319e9fbf015ab62188729a", "ja": "じいちゃんも、あたしが今までやったお仕事、\n全部知っててくれてねぇ。", "zh": "爷爷也知道我之前都做了哪些工作哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4bb9a369bde25055931f33fc343d8f194872a2790fbab511bc2fee1c0336501a", "ja": "全部？　それは凄いな……。\nお婆さんもお爺さんも、ひなたのファンなんだな。", "zh": "全都知道？那还真是厉害……\n看来日向的奶奶和爷爷都是你的粉丝呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "6235e7ab33b8ccca9b1eaf507da8f10c035f19e7ee353e13a3aa01b7623c8475", "ja": "えへへ……あたし、家族やファンのみんなに、\nいつも元気をもらってるべさ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……我总是从家人还有\n粉丝们那里得到了活力哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "ba4893981a360a40857d444f41dbcc37d13f67f7415c12ce1a2d882d25b4f0fd", "ja": "したっけ、みんなにお返しをしたいと思ったんだわ。", "zh": "所以，我想要回报大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "8f745b14fc3b5a1a953a366710227ad3653ec25bdf7e417d9d4d5875c09e4a78", "ja": "あたしはこのCMで、パンだけじゃなくて、\n元気も配達したいんだべさ。", "zh": "我在这支广告里，不只要送面包，\n也想将活力送出去哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1015_p", "source_sha256": "655fcbb43873944486098302d609346b0077ef77dcf089f3d078f1dd730f5705", "ja": "そうか。ひなたは見てくれる人達の事を、\nちゃんと意識してたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊，日向确实有将\n关注自己的人们放在心上呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1016_p", "source_sha256": "618ff7c4865ef817350133103dabf054b4b09bf30af32372ff54b4735eb476a6", "ja": "それができてれば、心配いらないな！\nひなた、最後まで頑張ろう！", "zh": "有做到这点就不用担心了！\n日向，加油做到最后吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "689072acf5b0b2244fa143a5c7a26fad304c43de0167a7fb10ecfe70add8c4c8", "ja": "うん。{$P$}、\nあたし、がんばるよぉ！", "zh": "嗯，{$P$}，\n我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1018_kantoku", "source_sha256": "e09d67dca8c9ce413a5c037e7b34613cd2f5e2112428dbfae333abb52deb08f6", "ja": "木下さん、そろそろ撮影再開します！\n準備、お願いしま～す！", "zh": "木下小姐，差不多要继续拍摄了！\n请做好准备～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "832de3289b1d9ea35a977c54b8be9bf540e31d9396a2bf397be3ba9a717ee0ec", "ja": "あっ、はーい！\n{$P$}、行ってくっからねぇ。", "zh": "啊，好的──！\n{$P$}，那我就过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "59b1bf2d5f70f140509b20ba881cb0cae8852266c4ea552f1e85ba6e83e338cf", "ja": "あたし、もっともーっと\nみんなを元気にできるよう、がんばるよぉ！", "zh": "我会努力加油，\n让大家能有更多更～多的活力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0114_1021_p", "source_sha256": "be10807e31e2f765e923328ff6472f1552bbdd662837abd3e053e393e170a180", "ja": "（ひなたの元気は、たくさんの人に届くだろう……\nもっと大勢にも、届けられるようにしてやりたいな！）", "zh": "（我想日向的活力肯定能送进许多人心里……\n我想帮助她传递给更多的人们！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
